==Verdanturf Town (optional)==
[[File:Verdanturf Town E.png|thumb|Verdanturf Town]]

{{to|Verdanturf}} is a small town just west of {{rt|117|Hoenn}}, at the foot of the mountains. Due to the prevailing wind pattern, the area is always kept clear of falling volcanic ash. [[Wally]] is visiting with his uncle's family here, in the hopes that the fresh, clean air will improve his health.

